I like, yeah, I like it.

00:57:10.900 --> 00:57:12.700
But you know, I mean,

00:57:12.700 --> 00:57:14.130
there's some deeply rooted things here.

00:57:14.130 --> 00:57:18.470
I just think that growing
up there was this scarcity.

00:57:18.470 --> 00:57:20.530
Now I'm not saying you grew
up rich or that you grew up,

00:57:20.530 --> 00:57:21.410
